Package: betadiversity
Title: Confidence Intervals and Hypothesis Tests for Beta Diversity
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Oded", "Hollander", , "odedhollander23@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes Whittaker's multiplicative and Lande's additive beta
    diversity from site-by-species presence/absence data, with analytical
    confidence intervals and a two-sample hypothesis test, following
    Kiflawi & Spencer (2004, Ecology 85(10):2895-2900).
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vegan
Config/testthat/edition: 3
